upati."},{"iast":"allama","name":"Allama","devanagari":"अल्लम","dictionary_gloss":"Name honouring the Veerashaiva saint Allama Prabhu; etymology uncertain."},{"iast":"pullayya","name":"Pullaiah","devanagari":"पुल्लय्य","dictionary_gloss":"Traditional Telugu respectful name (Pulla + ayya); etymology uncertain."},{"iast":"sāhil","name":"Sahil","devanagari":"साहिल","dictionary_gloss":"Shore; coast."},{"iast":"dama","name":"Dama","devanagari":"दम","dictionary_gloss":"Self-control, restraint, mastery over the senses."}]